meta {
  name: List skills
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/skills
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  Every discovered skill with its scope, what it requires, and — per CALLER — whether it is
  ready (`ready`, `missing`). A scoped skill with missing credentials is still listed rather
  than hidden, so a client can say exactly what to set.

  `detected_env` is what the skill's scripts look like they read: a suggestion for the admin
  form, not a declaration. `required_env` is what actually gates it, and PATCH overrides it.
}
